<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξᾰγορ-εύω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαγορεύσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epic.Alex.Adesp.</u>
					2.55
				</span></i>
			: aor. supplied by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξειπεῖν,</span>
			fut. and pf. (exc. in late authors) by
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερῶ,
				ἐξείρηκα</span>:—<i>tell out, make known,
				declare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκάστη ὃν γόνον ἐξαγόρευεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.234
				</span></i>
			; <i>betray</i> a secret or mystery, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.170
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.89
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀπόρρητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Pisc.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			; <i>confess,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἁμαρτίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					5.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.168d
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Rhetor.
			</span></i> in <i>Cat. Cod.Astr.</i><i><span class="en">
				8(4).148
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εύεσθαι τὸ πάθος</span>
				Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				142
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
